id: K8S-027
ilities: [integrity]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: warn
title: Ingress without TLS
category: security
severity: warning
engine: absence
target:
  extensions: .yaml .yml
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ .git/ vendor/
  content_contains: kind: Ingress
patterns:
  - regex: tls:
    message: "Ingress without TLS — traffic is unencrypted"
fix: Add a tls section to the Ingress spec with a secretName referencing a TLS certificate. Use cert-manager for automated certificate management.
